const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文在交易压力与收益行为的理论和实证框架中研究订单不平衡与个股收益的关系。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article asks how order imbalance relates to individual-stock returns, using a theoretical and empirical framing of trading pressure and return behavior. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(03)00175-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它把不平衡相关价格效应模型与个股层面的证据结合，方向规则和测量窗口均属于设计的一部分。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It combines a model of imbalance-related price effects with evidence at the individual-security level, so the direction rule and measurement window are part of the design. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(03)00175-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"可比研究需要成交方向或原文的订单不平衡代理、个股收益、报价语境、证券样本、时间戳口径和不交易处理。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"A comparable study needs trade direction or the paper's imbalance proxy, individual-security returns, quote context, security universe, timestamp convention, and treatment of nontrading. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(03)00175-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"标题和公开记录支持对订单不平衡与个股收益的有限研究，不支持把带符号成交量当成普适方向信号。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The title and public record support a bounded investigation of imbalance and individual returns, not the claim that signed volume alone is a universal directional signal. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(03)00175-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"记录成交方向识别、采样间隔、报价滞后、公司行动调整、零收益处理，以及不平衡按股数、金额还是笔数计算。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Document trade-signing method, sampling interval, quote lag, corporate-action adjustments, zero-return treatment, and whether imbalance is shares, dollars, or counts. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(03)00175-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Financial Economics (2004)。不同交易协议和缺失订单信息会改变不平衡测量，分钟K线不能无声替代原研究所需观测。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Financial Economics (2004). Different trading protocols and unavailable order information can change imbalance measurement, so minute bars cannot silently substitute for the study's underlying observations. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0304-405x(03)00175-2",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics (2004) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Order Imbalance and Individual Stock Returns: Theory and Evidence”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。不同交易协议和缺失订单信息会改变不平衡测量，分钟K线不能无声替代原研究所需观测。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Order Imbalance and Individual Stock Returns: Theory and Evidence”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
